    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a4-a9">

                <pb facs="0578" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg504"/>

                <head>No. 5.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Ferrol</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-14">February 14,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Chargé d’ Affaires of the United States of
                        America:</hi></p>
                <p>Stonewall will be ready to-day. English steamer came in called the Louisa Ann
                    Fanny. Very suspicious. We watch her.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
